WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.268
-It is the holiday season.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:04.971
So, in spirit of giving,
I got each team a gift.

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.939
And by gift,
I mean a mystery box

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:10.376
full of unknown
and possibly dangerous things.

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.011
[ Laughter ]

00:00:12.011 --> 00:00:13.813
Here's how this game works.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.681
Each box has some random objects
inside

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:18.250
that represent a well-known song
or artist.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.187
On your turn, you and your
partner will both reach inside

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.822
and try to figure out
the answer

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.491
using only your sense of touch.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:26.625
You have 45 seconds
to feel it out.

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:28.895
Each box is worth 1,000 points.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:31.931
And there may or may not be
live animals in some of these.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.200
Fred and Ana,
you're up first.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.236
Let's reveal what's in
your mystery box.

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:37.570
-Do we both feel stuff
at the same time?

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.105
-We're both at the same time,
right?

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.507
-Yes, you both feel.
Don't look.

00:00:41.507 --> 00:00:42.608
I'm revealing.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:45.512
♪♪

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:48.348
-Remember, it could be a person.
-Aah-aah-aah!

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:49.715
-It could be
a musical performer.

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:50.817
-It could be!

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:51.851
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:53.485
Let's get 45 seconds
on the clock.

00:00:53.485 --> 00:00:55.121
Shout out when you think
you know

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:57.256
what the song or artist it is.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:00:59.626
3, 2, 1...feel.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:00.760
-Here we go.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:01.928
♪♪

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.929
-Well, Freddy went right in.

00:01:03.929 --> 00:01:06.499
Ooh, my God!
Oh, my gosh! Fred!

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:09.235
