3, 2, 1.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:28.180
It's a song or an artist!
It's a song or an artist.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.415
-You're scaring me!

00:02:29.415 --> 00:02:30.749
-It's a song...or an artist.

00:02:30.749 --> 00:02:34.153
